[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12425.51, "timestamp": "03:27:05", "text": "嗯，总之，千万别花钻石。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12428.309, "timestamp": "03:27:08", "text": "腾出库存空间。制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12430.11, "timestamp": "03:27:10", "text": "子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12433.269, "timestamp": "03:27:13", "text": "人物。创建子角色。等级"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12436.95, "timestamp": "03:27:16", "text": "将它们升到 20 级，这样你就可以解锁了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12440.95, "timestamp": "03:27:20", "text": "等级升级。照做。好的。不要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12443.99, "timestamp": "03:27:23", "text": "从未花过钻石。那是坏笨蛋"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12447.67, "timestamp": "03:27:27", "text": "这是你在游戏中能做出的最愚蠢的操作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12452.03, "timestamp": "03:27:32", "text": "是的，只要确保你做到了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12455.99, "timestamp": "03:27:35", "text": "嗯，呃，创建所有游戏账号。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12461.11, "timestamp": "03:27:41", "text": "玩过 Alt 版，呃，不是所有神"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12464.469, "timestamp": "03:27:44", "text": "我到底在说什么？所有角色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12466.87, "timestamp": "03:27:46", "text": "其他课程"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12469.67, "timestamp": "03:27:49", "text": "次要角色。是的，只需提升他们的等级即可。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12472.229, "timestamp": "03:27:52", "text": "升到20级。嗯，你可以直接跳过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12474.55, "timestamp": "03:27:54", "text": "对话之类的。只需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12478.95, "timestamp": "03:27:58", "text": "1 小时可将一个角色升至 20 级"}]